{"last_link_id": 217, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["Krea 2 Turbo 反推图片 → 文生图 + LoRA + 高清放大 工作流\n\n流程：拖入图片 → Florence2 自然语言反推 → Krea 2 Turbo(8步) → VAE解码 → 高清放大 → 输出\n\n━━━ 模型文件（需下载到 ComfyUI/models/ 下）━━━\n  diffusion_models/krea2/krea2_turbo_fp8_scaled.safetensors\n  text_encoders/krea2/qwen3vl_4b_fp8_scaled.safetensors\n  vae/krea2/qwen_image_vae.safetensors\n  upscale_models/4x-UltraSharp.pth  ← 默认4x，可换其他倍数\n\n━━━ 放大倍数切换 ━━\n  在「放大模型」节点切换不同模型文件即可改变倍数：\n  2x → 2xAnimeSharp.pth / 2x_LDJPEG.pth\n  4x → 4x-UltraSharp.pth（默认）\n  8x → 8x_NMKD-Superscale.pth\n  下载：https://huggingface.co/uwg/upscaler/tree/main\n\n━━━ 反推提示词（Florence2 自然语言）━━━\n  需要在 ComfyUI Manager 安装：ComfyUI-Florence2\n  拖入任意图片，Florence2 自动生成自然语言描述（支持中英文）\n  large 模型更精准、base 模型更快\n  任务选 more_detailed_caption = 最详细的自然语言描述\n\n━━━ Krea 2 参数 ━━\n  步数: 8步 | 采样器: euler + simple | CFG: 1.0\n  基础分辨率: 1024x1024 | LoRA强度: 0.8（可调）"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [900, 560], "pos": [-3878.6259765625, -3425.087890625], "id": 1, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [213], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "size": [350, 380], "pos": [-2900, -3300], "widgets_values": ["e8e05fff85cf8dde8360d4f42ca9bc5339972a80f5c7641911ca29c0e779df31.jpg", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "id": 5, "type": "LoadImage", "title": "拖入参考图片", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.25.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [{"name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "locali